These files are used in CI builds.

`docker-build-experiments.txt` lists experiment directories that should be tested
via their own Dockerfiles in CI.

`run-ci-docker-command.sh` wraps the shared `docker run` arguments used by the
main CI test job and the custom Docker experiment test job.

`run-docker-experiment-tests.sh` runs the custom Docker experiment CI flow
(experiment discovery, CI-SHA dependency rewriting, image builds, pytest
execution, and failure log tails).

`run-pytest-with-common-flags.sh` centralizes shared pytest options (warnings,
browser mode, logging mode, and timeout).
